Output "/var/tmp/sesync-demo/out/tui-machines.gif"
Source common.tape
Hide
Type "/var/tmp/sesync-demo/reset-herdr.sh; . /var/tmp/sesync-demo/env.sh; rm -f ~/.config/sesync/tui.json; cd ~/projects/webshop; clear" Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 300ms
Type "herdr" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 3.5s
Ctrl+Alt+S Sleep 2.5s
Tab Sleep 400ms Tab Sleep 3s
Type "o" Sleep 7s
Type "Now add tests for it" Sleep 500ms Enter
Sleep 7s
